        "created_at": "2015-12-30T22:33:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Welp, it ended up not mattering -- both Galvanized cards were in his opening Ongoings. Wraith was able to throat punch him a couple times, and Tachyon started with two Hypersonic Assaults in hand, though, so it ended up being a relatively easy win.</p>",
